        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Stop PAwR advertising on an advertising set. Counterpart to <ref refid="group__sl__bt__pawr__advertiser_1ga3f5568699f9174b94bcac64aa9d39273" kindref="member">sl_bt_pawr_advertiser_start</ref>.</para>
<para>This command does not affect the enable state of the advertising set, i.e., legacy or extended advertising is not stopped.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">advertising_set</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The PAwR advertising set handle</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK if successful. Error code otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
